- Finalize supplier agreements with TechFlow Industries and PrecisionParts Manufacturing
- Submit regulatory filings for certification by 2025-02-18
- Conduct customer workshops with EuroGrid Energy and Global Defense Systems

**Short-term Milestones (Next 90 days):**
